# "leave site?" answered Cancel: kind 3, reload is kind 4, the page stays (and the app's own quit is refused)
script: leave.txt
env: BAA_HARNESS_DIALOG=cancel
exit: any
kill-after: 28
must: baa: dialog tab=0 id=\d+ kind=3
must: baa: dialog tab=0 id=\d+ kind=4
count: 2 get_state ok=true url=https://example.com/#
mustnot: get_state ok=true url=https://example.org/
